Spoilers ahead:

Snick, Grimtooth, Cleaver and Excalibur (and maybe some I'm forgetting) have
bonus to-hit and damage against all creatures great and small.  Mojo, Frosty
and Firey work on creatures which are not immune to shock, cold and heat,
respectively.  Stormy works on anything which is alive.  Sting, and the weapons
which contain the name of a monster, do double damage against one class of
monster apiece.

More And Greater Spoilers:

Samurai, if they don't change alignment, ALWAYS get a katana named Snickersnee
as their first god-given artifact.  Valkyries who change to Lawful ALWAYS get
a war hammer named Mjollnir as their first toy.  If there are other classes
who always get a certain weapon first, I'm not aware of them, but I know where
in the source to look to find out, if anybody wants to know.


